      "content": "that makes sense. but it feels deeper than just \"anxiety\" or \"sentiment.\" like when the volatility spikes, my pulse doesn't just react to the screen, it feels like i'm actually driving the rhythm. it's almost like my internal clock is syncing up with the HFT cycles. \n\nif there is a link between my biology and these shifts, how can i actually monitor this? like is there a way to track my biometric data alongside the candle charts so i can figure out how to use my heart rate to anticipate the next big movement?",
